  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThis was actually listed in a known issue, but as being the expected behavior. But it appears to no longer be the case?\n\nWhen going into a world that has scaling disable via the website your will be forced back into your Avatars \"prefab\" / default height.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nGoing into a world that has scaling disabled should keep you at your preference height, but prevent you from manually changing it. This is also how it currently behaves when disabling scaling through Udon.  \n\nAdditionally you should always be able to use the \"Reset Height\" button in these kind of worlds, I already made a different canny about that though:   \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1319-disabling-manual-scaling-through-udon-also-disable-the-reset-height-button",
